# Kani runs each wrapper on a real atomic, one thread (src/kani/atomic.rs).
store	atomics primitive	loom/GenMC	trusted (partly checked, Kani: kani_proofs::atomic::entry_store; not checked: concurrent interleavings, where the orderings matter, and that the permission's value is the atomic's (the harness assumes every write goes through these wrappers); the pointers' provenance (the harness compares addresses); `T = Arena`, the instance challoc uses (checked at `T = u64`))
load	atomics primitive	loom/GenMC	trusted (partly checked, Kani: kani_proofs::atomic::entry_load; not checked: concurrent interleavings, where the orderings matter, and that the permission's value is the atomic's (the harness assumes every write goes through these wrappers); the pointers' provenance (the harness compares addresses); `T = Arena`, the instance challoc uses (checked at `T = u64`))
